# Commercial skills — NEVER publish. `ghl-account-copilot` is the paid product
# sold at copymyaiagency.com/blueprint ($99, extension + skill); `ghl-build` and
# `ghl-json` are its ancestors and give away the same design. This repo is
# PUBLIC (zalo-claude-code-setup), so an untracked skill dir here is one
# `git add -A` away from publishing the thing being sold. Ignored, not trusted
# to a convention.
